    "Prove global ContDiff of each actual atom profile at every rank, including the empty rank-zero product.",
    "Prove exact positive multiplicative chart identity as the original log atom composed with affine slope 1/logN.",
    "Consume the real existing compact full-Frechet atom budget; derive the multiplicative chart bound by actual continuous-linear-map composition, with uniform log2 inverse cost.",
    "Use the frozen genuine ordered Euler/tensor dictionary to derive all-real-point fixed-order and finite-order syntactic mixedEuler constants for every actual atom.",
    "Construct one positive natural constant for every key in a finite genuine rank/cell/inner-outer atom bank, and before arbitrary HB occurrence rank, repeated-owner maps, scales and ordered words. No absent rank is replaced by a zero profile."
  ],
